\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Distribution of p-values under the null hypothesis across 5000 simulations. Under the correct analysis (top), p-values are uniformly spread between 0 and 1, the expected behaviour of a well-calibrated test. Under pseudoreplication (bottom), p-values pile up near zero, producing a large excess of spurious significant results. Red dashed line marks p = 0.05.}}{28}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig-pval}{{2.1}{28}{Distribution of p-values under the null hypothesis across 5000 simulations. Under the correct analysis (top), p-values are uniformly spread between 0 and 1, the expected behaviour of a well-calibrated test. Under pseudoreplication (bottom), p-values pile up near zero, producing a large excess of spurious significant results. Red dashed line marks p = 0.05}{figure.caption.6}{}}
